# hoi4_loader test: the blueprint layout of the test small arms (vanilla mechanism,
# interface/equipmentdesigner/_documentation.info; NOTES.md N14). Its first element covers the
# window's generic blueprint background with the mod's own; the rifle's body is always shown, and
# each installed module adds its picture: the barrel (rifle or SMG), a bayonet, grenades (one per
# kit slot, side by side) and the scope.
